{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo of Black Zen White, a puzzle platformer where the world alternates every 10 seconds between two slightly different versions: black then white. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your head, act at the right time and interact wisely with other inhabitants to find your way in this cute hand-drawn 2D game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to get to the end of this selection of levels drawn from the first world of the full game?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Act right at the right time...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597240/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_005_-_act_at_the_right_time.gif?t=1743160588\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">...get help from friends...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597240/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_006_-_get_help.gif?t=1743160588\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">...go through walls...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597240/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_009_-_go_through_walls.gif?t=1743160588\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">...unlock new abilities...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597240/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_008_-_unlock_abilities.gif?t=1743160588\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">...and find your way out!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597240/extras/Black_Zen_White_-_gif_007_-_find_your_way_out.gif?t=1743160588\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3597240?t=1743160588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage